{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:43:32+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T07:43:32+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"DCC Energy plc","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","country":"Ireland","city":"Dublin","website":"https://www.dccenergy.com","employees":11700,"summary":"DCC Energy plc engages in the sales, marketing, and distribution of carbon energy solutions in the Republic of Ireland, the United Kingdom, France, the United States, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, DCC Energy and DCC Technology. It sells transport and commercial fuels, heating oils and related products, liquid gas, refrigerants, electricity, natural gas; sells and distributes biofuels and biogas to commercial, industrial, and domestic customers; designs, sells, installs, and maintains on-site solar and energy systems for power customers, as well as provides energy efficiency solutions; owns or operates service stations (gas stations) for vehicles and trucks; and provides fleet payment, digital parking, and telematic services. The company also offers Pro Tech, which bring professional technologies together to enhance audio and visual experiences; Info Tech to make faster connections happen; and Life Tech that provides technology to improve lifestyle quality. The company was formerly known as DCC plc and changed its name to DCC Energy plc. in July 2026. The company was incorporated in 1976 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"DCC Energy plc se consacre à la vente, à la commercialisation et à la distribution de solutions d'énergie carbonée en République d'Irlande, au Royaume-Uni, en France, aux États-Unis et à l'international. La société opère dans deux secteurs, DCC Energy et DCC Technology. Elle vend des carburants de transport et commerciaux, des mazouts de chauffage et des produits connexes, du gaz liquide, des réfrigérants, de l'électricité et du gaz naturel; vend et distribue des biocarburants et du biogaz à des clients commerciaux, industriels et domestiques; conçoit, vend, installe et entretient des systèmes solaires et énergétiques sur site pour les clients du secteur de l'énergie, et fournit des solutions d'efficacité énergétique; possède ou exploite des stations-service (stations) pour véhicules et camions."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":5515732480,"shares_outstanding":85448992,"trailing_pe":18.132023,"forward_pe":11.954455,"price_to_book":296.0466,"ev_to_ebitda":8.8,"ev_to_revenue":0.417,"dividend_yield":0.0336,"payout_ratio":0.6483,"beta_yahoo":0.704},"targets":{"current_price":6455.0,"mean":6490.333,"median":6546.0,"high":6700.0,"low":6000.0,"n_analysts":6,"reco_mean":2.66667,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-10"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-28","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.06283,"institutions_pct":0.84370005,"institutions_float_pct":0.90026003,"institutions_n":214,"institutions":[{"name":"Legato Capital Management LLC","pct":0.0008,"shares":83140,"value":536668700,"date":"2022-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0146,"shares":1250596,"value":8072597180,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0029},{"name":"HARTFORD MUTUAL FUNDS INC/CT-The Hartford International Value Fund","pct":0.014099999,"shares":1202306,"value":7760885230,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0626},{"name":"Fidelity Puritan Trust-Fidelity Low-Priced Stock Fund","pct":0.0127,"shares":1088714,"value":7027648870,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":-0.38169998},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0098,"shares":834418,"value":5386168190,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.00059999997},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0082,"share